{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0057","name":"李悝","evidence":["wendi-q-p013"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-p013-wendi-p0057","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p013"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-q-p013","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-be23dc1148fe349c2990","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“初，郑甘、王照及卢水胡率其属来降。王得降书以示朝曰：‘前欲有令吾讨鲜卑者，吾不从而降；又有欲使吾及今秋讨卢水胡者，吾不听，今又降。昔魏武侯一谋而当，有自得之色，见讥李悝。吾今说此，非自是也；徒以为坐而降之，其功大于动兵革也。’”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8df4b464251e54dc3337","start":0,"end":124}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
